# Profession texture directory
#
# Place PNG files here to give Guard and Merchant custom appearance:
#
#   guard.png    — profession overlay for Guard villagers
#                  Rendered by vanilla VillagerProfessionLayer (automatic).
#
#   merchant.png — profession overlay for Merchant villagers
#                  MerchantColorLayer renders the Wandering Trader texture
#                  (minecraft:textures/entity/wandering_trader.png) over this
#                  with a biome-derived DyeColor tint. This file can remain
#                  blank or serve as a fallback; the layer handles appearance.
#
# Without these files the renderer shows the purple/black missing-texture
# checkerboard. The mod compiles and runs correctly either way.
